Keep Copilot Chat BYOK execution owned by the remote/server Agent Host so an
active turn can continue while the browser is inactive, reloaded, or closed.
Direct-capable BYOK provider descriptors are handed to Agent Host memory only;
unsupported provider shapes retain the upstream renderer bridge fallback.

Security: syncEphemeralByokModels can carry credentials. AhpJsonlLogger redacts
that notification before JSONL serialization and records counts only. The
sentinel regression test must remain green so keys, headers, bearer tokens, and
private endpoints never enter AHP transport logs.

Reproduction: start a long-running BYOK Agent Host turn, then make the renderer
inactive, hard-reload it, and fully close it. The same turn must continue on the
server without a new user message and reconnect to the same progressed session.

